  = note: `<data>` gets its initial value from exactly one of `src` (a URI), `expr` (an expression), or inline child content; with several the value is ambiguous
  = help: keep one value source and remove the other 2: for example, remove `expr` and `src`
  = spec: SCXML 1.0 §5.3 <data>
help: remove `expr` and `src`
